  {
    "id": "N038-1-0002",
    "chapter": 38,
    "title": "林瀟湘魁奪菊花詩　薛蘅蕪諷和螃蟹詠",
    "source": "Dream-of-Red-Chamber-master/脂硯齋重評石頭記/chapters/chapter38.tex",
    "location": {
      "start_offset": 122,
      "end_offset": 182,
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2
    },
    "layer": "zhiyan",
    "current_text": "蒙回前總批：湘雲，詩客也，前回寫之其今才起社，後用不即不離閑人數語數折，仍歸社中。何巧活之筆如此？",
    "raw_sha256": "28ec08bfc85dba1c32ff750fd466d5b4ed40d191108a252d3e74ee00c9091b80",
    "excluded_raw_ref": null,
    "in_selected_chapter_span": true,
    "confidence": "medium",
    "allowed_for_inference": "commentary_only_explicit_opt_in",
    "is_supplement": false,
    "reason": "保留本地传统批本标签；标签不证明批者身份或真伪",
    "nested_editorial_ids": []
